type: software
title: "PEA-PGNN Drying-Shrinkage Prediction GUI"
abstract: >-
  A Windows desktop research application for checksummed PEA-PGNN concrete
  drying-shrinkage prediction, reference-equation comparison, protected custom
  formula editing, numerical trial calculation, batch prediction, and
  deterministic PDF calculation reports.
